zations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T12:34:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T12:34:48Z","body":"> That sounds unlikely are you wiping all the code and disabling the cache? It can't take 3 times as long to rebuild just the changes to `project_settings.h` as rebuilding the entire engine\r\n\r\nSorry I haven't state it clear. It is time to go through all files but recompile nothing, essentially equals to run the command twice and measure the second run (which does nothing) time. Just as @Ivorforce said it is scons overhead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575437946/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575661532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113146#issuecomment-3575661532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113146","id":3575661532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VIEPc","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T13:27:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T13:28:31Z","body":"Added a new commit that moves `GET_GLOBAL_CACHED` into `global_def.h`.\r\n\r\nOne potential issue is `uint32_t _ggc_new_version = ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->get_version();`. To isolate the dependency, `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->get_version()` was wrapped into `_GLOBAL_GET_VERSION()`, which prevents this part from being inlined in a normal build (it should still be inlined under LTO). Since this line appears on a hot path, depending on call frequency it may introduce some performance impact. I’m not very familiar with the callers involved here, so I need to familliarize myself with the code first and possibly run some profiling later.\r\n\r\nThis change doesn’t affect rebuild time very much. The rebuild time of touching `project_settings.h` is now 83s, which is 6s shorter.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575661532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575732889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113146#issuecomment-3575732889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113146","id":3575732889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VIVqZ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"htt